-//!
-//! Layout (see `spec/OPCODE.md`):
-//!
-//! ```text
-//! [Category: u8][Command: u8][Flags: u16][A: u32][B: u32][C: u32]
-//! ```
-//!
-//! All multi-byte fields are little-endian on the wire. `size_of::<Opcode>() == 16`,
-//! so a 64-byte cache line holds exactly 4 opcodes.
