 //!
 //! The protocol carries only raw inputs (`POINTER_DOWN` / `POINTER_UP` /
 //! `POINTER_MOVE`, …). High-level interpretations — tap, drag, long-press — are
 //! built by the application from those raw events. [`TapRecognizer`] is the
